====Synonyms====
* {{l|ru|чё}} or {{l|ru|чо}} {{qualifier|interrogative pronoun only, non-standard, highly colloquial but common, not used in formal writing}}
*: {{uxi|ru|[[ну|Ну]] '''чё''', [[пойти|пошли́]], [[что́ ли]]?|Well, let's go!|subst=что́ ли//што́ ли}}
*: {{uxi|ru|'''Чё''' [[он]] [[хотеть|хо́чет]] [[от]] [[я|меня́]]?|What (the hell) does he want from me?}}
* {{l|ru|шо}} {{qualifier|same as above, used in the South of European Russia or by Russian speakers in Ukraine}}
* {{l|ru|кото́рый}} {{qualifier|standard relative pronoun}}

